  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like gaseous form, except the target becomes a visible swirl of hot ash and smoke instead of harmless translucent gas. The target gains the fire subtype. Any creature that begins its turn sharing a space with the target takes 2d6 points of fire damage and must make a Fortitude save (DC 15, + 1 per previous check) or suffer the effects of smoke inhalation.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like gaseous form, except the target becomes a visible swirl of hot ash and smoke instead of harmless translucent gas. the target gains the fire subtype. any creature that begins its turn sharing a space with the target takes 2d6 points of fire damage and must make a fortitude save (dc 15, + 1 per previous check) or suffer the effects of smoke inhalation.\"",
